# Web Chat UI

## Required components

- `chat.tsx` — streaming message list, input, loading states.
- `citation.tsx` — clickable source chips from `{ source_url, title, snippet }`.
- `tool-call-indicator.tsx` — visible record of MCP tool invocations and results.

## API route

`app/api/chat/route.ts` — streaming endpoint using Vercel AI SDK; delegates to `packages/agent`.

## UX requirements

- Stream tokens as they arrive.
- Citations render inline or below the answer — always clickable to source.
- Tool calls show name + outcome (not hidden in logs only).
- Errors surface gracefully without leaking internal stack traces.

## Stack

Next.js App Router, Vercel AI SDK, shared types from `packages/shared`.
